p to  go any further what happens  well we will go step by step the  agreement that was signed last friday  here in istanbul in fact lists a number  of uh articles and actions  when we face a situation like this we  will of course implement you know those  conditions that the provisions require  that both sides to stick only to this  agreement only agricultural products are  carried no other like weapons of any of  any kind will be carried and therefore  there will be a mechanism to inspect  them so there will be an inspection team  here uh and that team will include  representatives from ukraine russia u.n  and turkey uh and therefore we will have  a mechanism here uh the logistic side of  it in fact will uh work as it worked  before the war uh how you know a ship  you know leaves say odessa port or  another port from russia and bleachers  international waters and the black sea  reaches the bosphorus and then from here  goes to its final destination  if there is an issue there are a number  of provisions immediately this uh joint  uh coordination center and  representatives there you know will have  their uh consultations there and of  course we want to make sure that  everything you know goes smoothly but if  there are issues there are mechanisms in  place that will address those issues we  shall see what happens in the coming  hours in the moment ibrahim

